  "body_text": "96 \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n Request an invite \r\n Hello Axios insider, \n\n &nbsp;\n\n \r\n Dan Primack here, Axios business editor and author of the Pro Rata newsletter. \n\n &nbsp;\n\n \r\n Mark your calendars, we're back . &nbsp; Our fifth annual dealmakers summit Axios BFD returns to New York City on November 17.&nbsp; \n\n \r\n Join us for a half-day summit featuring the power players behind the year’s biggest deals in tech, finance, private equity and M&A. Speaker lineup to be announced soon. &nbsp; \r\n 🗓️ When: Tuesday, November 17, 2026 | 1:30pm - 7:30pm ET \n\n 📍 Where: New York City, NY \n\n \r\n &#8202; 💸 Catch up quick: Axios BFD NY 2025 Photo credit: Sam Popp on behalf of Axios\n\n \r\n Flashback: Last year, Axios BFD convened over 400 dealmakers and industry leaders for candid conversations with the power players shaping the biggest deals across tech, finance, private equity, M&A and more.&nbsp;&nbsp; \n\n \r\n Featured speakers included RedBird Capital Partners founder and managing partner&nbsp; Gerry Cardinale , Coinbase president and COO&nbsp; Emilie Choi , Polymarket founder and CEO&nbsp; Shayne Coplan , Hugging Face CEO and co-founder&nbsp; Clem Delangue ,founder/entrepreneur/podcast host &nbsp;Emma Grede , Affirm founder and CEO&nbsp; Max Levchin and many more. \r\n Go deeper: Watch newsworthy discussions from BFD NY 2025 here .&nbsp; \n\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n Sign up for updates \r\n \r\n &#8202; \r\n 📣 If you're interested in subscribing to our daily Axios Pro Rata&nbsp; newsletter, click &nbsp; here &nbsp;to learn more. \r\n\n &nbsp;\n\n Look forward to seeing you there,&nbsp; \n\n \n Dan Primack\n Business Editor, Axios \n\n \r\n &#8202; \r\n Contact Us \n\r\n Update Preferences \n Unsubscribe \n\n \r\n Contact Us \n Update Preferences \n\r\n Unsubscribe \n\n PO Box 101060\n\n\r\n Arlington, VA 22201\n\n \r\n PO Box 101060 \n Arlington VA 22201 \n\n \r\n Facebook \n\r\n X \n Instagram \n\n LinkedIn \n\n \r\n Facebook \n X \n\r\n Instagram \n\n LinkedIn",
